#: ../../ml/likelihood.rst:5
msgid "最尤推定と最小二乗法"
msgstr "Maximum Likelihood Estimation and Least Squares"

#: ../../ml/likelihood.rst:9
msgid "最尤推定法と最小二乗法の等価性"
msgstr "Equivalence of Maximum Likelihood Estimation and Least Squares"

#: ../../ml/likelihood.rst:11
msgid "出力データの生成モデル（\\ :ref:`尤度関数<likelihood_function>`\\ ）として、式 :eq:`ml3`"
msgstr ""
"For the model that generates the output data (\\ :ref:`likelihood "
"function <likelihood_function>`\\ ), use Equation :eq:`ml3`."

#: ../../ml/likelihood.rst:13
msgid ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^N(\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)^N}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})^\\top "
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"\\right)}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(2\\pi)^N(\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2)^N}}\n"
"\\exp{\\left(\n"
"-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})^\\top "
"(\\boldsymbol{t}-\\boldsymbol{\\Phi}\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"\\right)}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/likelihood.rst:22
msgid "を採用し、実測データの発生確率を上げるように分布関数の未知パラメータを決める最尤推定を実行しよう。 上式の対数をとる"
msgstr ""
"To perform maximum likelihood estimation, we choose the unknown "
"parameters of this distribution to make the observed data as probable as "
"possible. Taking the logarithm of this likelihood function gives"

#: ../../ml/likelihood.rst:25
msgid ""
"\\ln{p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{w})}\n"
"=\n"
"- \\frac{N\\ln2\\pi}{2} - \\frac{N\\ln\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}{2}\n"
"- \\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2} \\sum_{n=1}^N (t_n - "
"y(\\boldsymbol{x_n},\\boldsymbol{w}) )^2 .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\ln{p(\\boldsymbol{t} | \\boldsymbol{X}, \\boldsymbol{w})}\n"
"=\n"
"- \\frac{N\\ln2\\pi}{2} - \\frac{N\\ln\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}{2}\n"
"- \\frac{1}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2} \\sum_{n=1}^N (t_n - "
"y(\\boldsymbol{x_n},\\boldsymbol{w}) )^2 .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/likelihood.rst:32
#, python-brace-format
msgid "これを最大化するには、次式を :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}` について最小化すればよい"
msgstr ""
"To maximize this expression, minimize the following function with respect"
" to :math:`\\boldsymbol{w}`."

#: ../../ml/likelihood.rst:34
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"L(\\boldsymbol{w}) = \\frac{1}{2} \\sum_{n=1}^N (t_n - "
"y(\\boldsymbol{x_n},\\boldsymbol{w}) )^2 .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"L(\\boldsymbol{w}) = \\frac{1}{2} \\sum_{n=1}^N (t_n - "
"y(\\boldsymbol{x_n},\\boldsymbol{w}) )^2 .\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/likelihood.rst:38
msgid "これは最小二乗問題に他ならない。"
msgstr "This is precisely a least-squares problem."

#: ../../ml/likelihood.rst:44
msgid "ハイパーパラメータについての最尤推定"
msgstr "Maximum Likelihood Estimation of Hyperparameters"

#: ../../ml/likelihood.rst:46
msgid ""
"式 :eq:`ml4` において、 :math:`\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2` "
"についての最大化を考えることもできる。微分してゼロとおくと"
msgstr ""
"We can also maximize Equation :eq:`ml4` with respect to "
":math:`\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2`. Setting the derivative with respect to "
"this variance to zero gives"

#: ../../ml/likelihood.rst:48
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"- \\frac{N}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"+ \\frac{1}{\\left(\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2\\right)^2} L(\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"= 0\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"- \\frac{N}{2\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2}\n"
"+ \\frac{1}{\\left(\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2\\right)^2} L(\\boldsymbol{w})\n"
"= 0\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/likelihood.rst:53
msgid ""
"\\therefore\n"
"\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{2 L(\\boldsymbol{w})}{N}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\therefore\n"
"\\sigma_\\varepsilon^2\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{2 L(\\boldsymbol{w})}{N}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../ml/likelihood.rst:60
msgid "が得られる。"
msgstr "This is the maximum likelihood estimate of the noise variance."

